[
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.577",
    "end": "00:00:11.745",
    "start_seconds": 10.577,
    "end_seconds": 11.745,
    "text": "My name is Jocelyn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.745",
    "end": "00:00:15.782",
    "start_seconds": 11.745,
    "end_seconds": 15.782,
    "text": "I am a member of the Voorhees Toastmaster Club, District 38,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.882",
    "end": "00:00:21.154",
    "start_seconds": 15.882,
    "end_seconds": 21.154,
    "text": "and I am the World Champion of Public Speaking for 2023."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.254",
    "end": "00:00:25.992",
    "start_seconds": 21.254,
    "end_seconds": 25.992,
    "text": "Can you tell me every emotion that is going through your body right now?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.059",
    "end": "00:00:27.761",
    "start_seconds": 26.059,
    "end_seconds": 27.761,
    "text": "It's just surreal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.761",
    "end": "00:00:30.797",
    "start_seconds": 27.761,
    "end_seconds": 30.797,
    "text": "You ever have a wave of just, \"I can't believe this is happening?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.797",
    "end": "00:00:35.135",
    "start_seconds": 30.797,
    "end_seconds": 35.135,
    "text": "It's almost an out of body kind of vibe, but it's just... I'm excited,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.135",
    "end": "00:00:38.405",
    "start_seconds": 35.135,
    "end_seconds": 38.405,
    "text": "I'm ecstatic, I am speechless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.505",
    "end": "00:00:41.508",
    "start_seconds": 38.505,
    "end_seconds": 41.508,
    "text": "And it's just—"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.508",
    "end": "00:00:42.809",
    "start_seconds": 41.508,
    "end_seconds": 42.809,
    "text": "amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.809",
    "end": "00:00:45.478",
    "start_seconds": 42.809,
    "end_seconds": 45.478,
    "text": "What went through your mind when you heard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.478",
    "end": "00:00:48.481",
    "start_seconds": 45.478,
    "end_seconds": 48.481,
    "text": "your name called as World Champion?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.715",
    "end": "00:00:49.983",
    "start_seconds": 48.715,
    "end_seconds": 49.983,
    "text": "First thing: What?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.983",
    "end": "00:00:51.317",
    "start_seconds": 49.983,
    "end_seconds": 51.317,
    "text": "What? Wait... what? Me?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.317",
    "end": "00:00:55.755",
    "start_seconds": 51.317,
    "end_seconds": 55.755,
    "text": "Wait, me, me, just. Me?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.822",
    "end": "00:01:00.360",
    "start_seconds": 55.822,
    "end_seconds": 60.36,
    "text": "I think that was the first thing and still feel like it's going on right now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.460",
    "end": "00:01:02.095",
    "start_seconds": 60.46,
    "end_seconds": 62.095,
    "text": "Can this be me?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.095",
    "end": "00:01:06.699",
    "start_seconds": 62.095,
    "end_seconds": 66.699,
    "text": "But I worked hard and it was a labor of love."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.766",
    "end": "00:01:09.969",
    "start_seconds": 66.766,
    "end_seconds": 69.969,
    "text": "So I'm just grateful. Just grateful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.070",
    "end": "00:01:13.073",
    "start_seconds": 70.07,
    "end_seconds": 73.07300000000001,
    "text": "Who helped get you to where you were?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.139",
    "end": "00:01:14.140",
    "start_seconds": 73.139,
    "end_seconds": 74.14,
    "text": "It was definitely"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.140",
    "end": "00:01:18.144",
    "start_seconds": 74.14,
    "end_seconds": 78.144,
    "text": "family, friends, fellow Toastmasters, non-Toastmasters,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.144",
    "end": "00:01:20.980",
    "start_seconds": 78.144,
    "end_seconds": 80.98,
    "text": "and just different audiences that I was bringing the speech to."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.980",
    "end": "00:01:24.084",
    "start_seconds": 80.98,
    "end_seconds": 84.084,
    "text": "I just wanted to be relatable to them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.084",
    "end": "00:01:27.487",
    "start_seconds": 84.084,
    "end_seconds": 87.487,
    "text": "and everyone when I was giving that speech because I practiced with them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.587",
    "end": "00:01:31.624",
    "start_seconds": 87.587,
    "end_seconds": 91.624,
    "text": "I spent time with them and just pooled and cultivated this thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.691",
    "end": "00:01:33.226",
    "start_seconds": 91.691,
    "end_seconds": 93.226,
    "text": "And that's who I thought of."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.226",
    "end": "00:01:36.229",
    "start_seconds": 93.226,
    "end_seconds": 96.229,
    "text": "And just also having fun and remembering that day"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.229",
    "end": "00:01:37.964",
    "start_seconds": 96.229,
    "end_seconds": 97.964,
    "text": "and remembering what brought me there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.964",
    "end": "00:01:39.966",
    "start_seconds": 97.964,
    "end_seconds": 99.96600000000001,
    "text": "and that that speech was my story."
  }
]
